    "GENERATED by `python3 sim/run_offset_cm_band.py build`; the committed copy is byte-for-byte what was submitted.",
    "CHARACTERIZATION (issue #79), condition vcm-p050: whole-latch input-referred offset at input common mode dut_vcm+50 mV, one mismatch draw per klt sim Monte-Carlo sample, N = 60 per PVT point. Not a DR-0002 compliance measurement: no whole-latch common-mode range is ratified.",
